    {
      "value": "<p>Still in the field, and for the most part not on the world it is about: everything known of the lake settlements arrives through traders in the next system, so the study follows the material rather than the people. It has so far established a chain of four intermediaries, a consistent set of makers&#39; marks and a seasonal rhythm to what is offered. What it has not established is whether anybody on the world knows the study exists, a question its ethics submission treats at length and does not resolve.</p>",
